(5564931, 805490, 89116, '<td valign="top">I do really like the composition and the concept of the shot.  Two things that knock it down for me though are: I can''t see any detail in the shoe, although there may not be any, it just looks like a dark figure; and there seems to be a lot of noise especially in the crack of the door.  Just my two cents to help you out next time.</td>', 'I do really like the composition and the concept of the shot.  Two things that knock it down for me though are: I can''t see any detail in the shoe, although there may not be any, it just looks like a dark figure; and there seems to be a lot of noise especially in the crack of the door.  Just my two cents to help you out next time.', '2009-07-08 10:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5564936, 805322, 89116, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to figure out what this was actually a picture of.  Now that I see it though, I do find it pretty funny.</td>', 'It took me awhile to figure out what this was actually a picture of.  Now that I see it though, I do find it pretty funny.', '2009-07-08 10:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5564940, 805239, 89116, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and the composition and it has a really cool concept to it.  One thing that would make it better is if the colors in the background were better.  The shot overall seems kind of flat.  Maybe try going back during sunset/sunrise when the sky is really colorful.  Just two cents to help you out next time.</td>', 'I like this shot and the composition and it has a really cool concept to it.  One thing that would make it better is if the colors in the background were better.  The shot overall seems kind of flat.  Maybe try going back during sunset/sunrise when the sky is really colorful.  Just two cents to help you out next time.', '2009-07-08 10:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
