(5565071, 805008, 89116, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot!  I like the colors and depth of field.  The placement of the shoes also fills the frame very nicely. I feel like the whole top third of the frame is unnecessary.  It just seems empty with all the green/yellow space.  I would crop it down a bit and see how that works.</td>', 'Very interesting shot!  I like the colors and depth of field.  The placement of the shoes also fills the frame very nicely. I feel like the whole top third of the frame is unnecessary.  It just seems empty with all the green/yellow space.  I would crop it down a bit and see how that works.', '2009-07-08 12:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565154, 805450, 89116, '<td valign="top">This shot is decent.  I like how the shoes are laid out and the different colors in the shot but it seems like you could''ve done a bit more such as even placing the shoes on some really green grass would''ve added a lot to the shot.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, I''m just trying to help by providing my two cents and you can take it or leave it.</td>', 'This shot is decent.  I like how the shoes are laid out and the different colors in the shot but it seems like you could''ve done a bit more such as even placing the shoes on some really green grass would''ve added a lot to the shot.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, I''m just trying to help by providing my two cents and you can take it or leave it.', '2009-07-08 12:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
