(5565238, 805212, 98186, '<td valign="top">The old warn books and the half used cigar seem out of place next to newer looking boots and a crisp, new looking hat.  But, it''s a cool setup and I really like it.</td>', 'The old warn books and the half used cigar seem out of place next to newer looking boots and a crisp, new looking hat.  But, it''s a cool setup and I really like it.', '2009-07-08 13:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
