(5565246, 805326, 98186, '<td valign="top">I think I''m missing what the title is implying.  I like it overall but it is a bit overwhelming with all the colors and shapes.</td>', 'I think I''m missing what the title is implying.  I like it overall but it is a bit overwhelming with all the colors and shapes.', '2009-07-08 13:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565260, 804021, 98186, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the depth of field.  There are a few blades of grass in the foreground that are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the color and the depth of field.  There are a few blades of grass in the foreground that are a bit distracting.', '2009-07-08 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
