(5565271, 805323, 98186, '<td valign="top">Very unique and cool picture.  I wish I could see just a bit more detail in the shadows.  Maybe it seems underexposed to me... not sure.  I''m still giving a high score for the cool concept because I don''t always trust my judgment when it comes to post processing.</td>', 'Very unique and cool picture.  I wish I could see just a bit more detail in the shadows.  Maybe it seems underexposed to me... not sure.  I''m still giving a high score for the cool concept because I don''t always trust my judgment when it comes to post processing.', '2009-07-08 13:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565273, 805490, 98186, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea but it''s not sharp enough for my taste.</td>', 'Nice Idea but it''s not sharp enough for my taste.', '2009-07-08 13:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565276, 805311, 98186, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  This must have taken a little time to set up.  Those white specs at the bottom of the picture should be edited out, but it''s a basic editing challenge so I won''t take a point for that :)</td>', 'Very creative.  This must have taken a little time to set up.  Those white specs at the bottom of the picture should be edited out, but it''s a basic editing challenge so I won''t take a point for that :)', '2009-07-08 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
