(5565309, 805268, 98186, '<td valign="top">A very nice picture but if I didn''t know that this was a footwear challenge I would not know that the shoes are the main subject.</td>', 'A very nice picture but if I didn''t know that this was a footwear challenge I would not know that the shoes are the main subject.', '2009-07-08 14:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
