(5565441, 803908, 106888, '<td valign="top">I think that this is an intriguing idea, except that neither the floor, the shoes, or the urinal are in focus.  This factor takes a lot away from the photo.  I do like, however, the symmetry and the fact that you''ve captured just enough of the urinal to make it recognizable.... and of course that wonderful residue that often resides on the floor beneath urinals.</td>', 'I think that this is an intriguing idea, except that neither the floor, the shoes, or the urinal are in focus.  This factor takes a lot away from the photo.  I do like, however, the symmetry and the fact that you''ve captured just enough of the urinal to make it recognizable.... and of course that wonderful residue that often resides on the floor beneath urinals.', '2009-07-08 15:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565443, 804121, 97073, '<td valign="top">Unusual crop but nice feel to image</td>', 'Unusual crop but nice feel to image', '2009-07-08 15:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
