(5565486, 805384, 89116, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract-ness to the shot and the warm tones from the light source and the green and orange colors.  All of that together makes this a great shot. Nice job!</td>', 'I like the abstract-ness to the shot and the warm tones from the light source and the green and orange colors.  All of that together makes this a great shot. Nice job!', '2009-07-08 15:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565487, 804021, 89116, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the back to foreground relationship.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I love the colors and the back to foreground relationship.  Nicely done!', '2009-07-08 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565493, 804785, 89116, '<td valign="top">I love the side lighting from what looks like a window.</td>', 'I love the side lighting from what looks like a window.', '2009-07-08 16:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565494, 805323, 89116, '<td valign="top">I love the natural-looking side light, it really adds to this shot.  The hands and shoes are beautiful but without the light the way it is it would''ve looked really boring, as well you probably know.</td>', 'I love the natural-looking side light, it really adds to this shot.  The hands and shoes are beautiful but without the light the way it is it would''ve looked really boring, as well you probably know.', '2009-07-08 16:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565495, 805268, 89116, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love when I see an image and get a sense of the people in the shot without seeing their faces.  I also really like how the dead leaves are scattered around the sidewalk.  One thing I would do to it is either show all of the flowers or none of them at all.  It seems cut off and uncomfortable.</td>', 'Wow!  I love when I see an image and get a sense of the people in the shot without seeing their faces.  I also really like how the dead leaves are scattered around the sidewalk.  One thing I would do to it is either show all of the flowers or none of them at all.  It seems cut off and uncomfortable.', '2009-07-08 16:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565496, 805007, 89116, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the concept of this shot.  The shoes are set up really nicely as well. Nice Job!  One thing that keeps it from a very high score is all the empty space in the top-right.  I feel like the back shoe points my eye right into nothingness.  Try cropping it out if you can.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the concept of this shot.  The shoes are set up really nicely as well. Nice Job!  One thing that keeps it from a very high score is all the empty space in the top-right.  I feel like the back shoe points my eye right into nothingness.  Try cropping it out if you can.', '2009-07-08 16:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565497, 805289, 89116, '<td valign="top">I really like the softness of this shot.  The sun seems like it really is kissing her feet.  As well, I like all the consistent brown tones throughout the image.  Since everything is neutral, though, the bits of green coming up really attract my eye away from the subject.  Next time, I would''ve pulled them up to add more emphasis on all the soft browns in the shot.  But other than that the lighting really makes this shot.  Nice Job!</td>', 'I really like the softness of this shot.  The sun seems like it really is kissing her feet.  As well, I like all the consistent brown tones throughout the image.  Since everything is neutral, though, the bits of green coming up really attract my eye away from the subject.  Next time, I would''ve pulled them up to add more emphasis on all the soft browns in the shot.  But other than that the lighting really makes this shot.  Nice Job!', '2009-07-08 16:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565500, 804099, 89116, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot!</td>', 'Very interesting shot!', '2009-07-08 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5565573, 805353, 86218, '<td valign="top">The range in light makes for a little distraction here and maybe to many subjects to focus on. I like the outdoor setting but softer light will def help here</td>', 'The range in light makes for a little distraction here and maybe to many subjects to focus on. I like the outdoor setting but softer light will def help here', '2009-07-08 17:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
