(5566811, 804853, 108427, '<td valign="top">Righteous, great spirit!</td>', 'Righteous, great spirit!', '2009-07-09 14:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5566812, 805474, 108427, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far! Reminds me of the Wizard of Oz for some reason. The back shoe looks almost as if the person was in the middle of a step; it is lifted a bit off the ground. Great effect. 10.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far! Reminds me of the Wizard of Oz for some reason. The back shoe looks almost as if the person was in the middle of a step; it is lifted a bit off the ground. Great effect. 10.', '2009-07-09 14:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5566817, 805078, 108427, '<td valign="top">Wow! Absolutely perfect everything. The colors are what gets me - great blues and even some yellow in the reflections in the water. Hope you get top 10!</td>', 'Wow! Absolutely perfect everything. The colors are what gets me - great blues and even some yellow in the reflections in the water. Hope you get top 10!', '2009-07-09 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5566819, 805345, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it''s a nice catch and the colors are really nice...i just don''t see a footwear as the prime object there... i may be wrong, but in my opinion there was too much pp too! I hope you don''t take this bad! Good luck to you!</td>', 'I like this shot, it''s a nice catch and the colors are really nice...i just don''t see a footwear as the prime object there... i may be wrong, but in my opinion there was too much pp too! I hope you don''t take this bad! Good luck to you!', '2009-07-09 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5566858, 804084, 99981, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a low vote because those feet look really OOF. The light is ok, but there is a big black part on the top which i really didn''t get. But still, i like your idea and with more tweaking i''m sure you can do better. <br/>Sorry if i was rude, that is just my opinion.</td>', 'I gave this shot a low vote because those feet look really OOF. The light is ok, but there is a big black part on the top which i really didn''t get. But still, i like your idea and with more tweaking i''m sure you can do better. Sorry if i was rude, that is just my opinion.', '2009-07-09 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
