(5567209, 805036, 99981, '<td valign="top">I gave a low vote to this image because i think the prime object is this girl at the front, in second place the other girl, and then her boots...I really like the colors of this image and the light adds something pleasing to it! I hope you don''t take my comment bad, i just gave my opinion!<br/>Good luck to you!</td>', 'I gave a low vote to this image because i think the prime object is this girl at the front, in second place the other girl, and then her boots...I really like the colors of this image and the light adds something pleasing to it! I hope you don''t take my comment bad, i just gave my opinion!Good luck to you!', '2009-07-09 20:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567210, 805247, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, the light and the idea in general. I just don''t understand that big border, which i think is unnecessary...and i wish there was more focus on the sneakers...</td>', 'I like the colors, the light and the idea in general. I just don''t understand that big border, which i think is unnecessary...and i wish there was more focus on the sneakers...', '2009-07-09 20:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
