(5567212, 804090, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the light, the color and i always like macro shots. I just think that you could have cropped the top, because those white parts are distracting, and the macro is kind of confusing, because i don''t know where to look with so much areas out of focus, maybe you can try a different perspective next time!<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I like the light, the color and i always like macro shots. I just think that you could have cropped the top, because those white parts are distracting, and the macro is kind of confusing, because i don''t know where to look with so much areas out of focus, maybe you can try a different perspective next time!Good luck!', '2009-07-09 20:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567213, 804472, 99981, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the subject and the pp, i can''t understand the red and yellow thing too. Try to shoot something more surprising and use less pp next time! Good luck!</td>', 'I really don''t like the subject and the pp, i can''t understand the red and yellow thing too. Try to shoot something more surprising and use less pp next time! Good luck!', '2009-07-09 20:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567214, 803802, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well, seeing from here i think i like the colors, maybe a B&amp;W would be nice..i just think the floor doesn''t help much and your shot is reeeeally small, and that will take a lot of good votes from you.<br/>Next time watch out for the permited sizes for images:<br/># File Size: 150 kb or less.<br/># Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels. <br/>I always use 640 pixels...<br/>Good luck anyway! Sorry if i was rude!</td>', 'Well, seeing from here i think i like the colors, maybe a B&W would be nice..i just think the floor doesn''t help much and your shot is reeeeally small, and that will take a lot of good votes from you.Next time watch out for the permited sizes for images:# File Size: 150 kb or less.# Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels. I always use 640 pixels...Good luck anyway! Sorry if i was rude!', '2009-07-09 20:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567215, 804915, 99981, '<td valign="top">The choice of object was nice, but i think the colors are kind of dead and the boots look a little oof. I don''t see much connection between the place and the boots too. From the sunlight back there i see you had a good light at that moment, maybe in a different place and some use of that light would be a good scenery for the shot! Sorry if i was rude in any opinion! Good luck to you!</td>', 'The choice of object was nice, but i think the colors are kind of dead and the boots look a little oof. I don''t see much connection between the place and the boots too. From the sunlight back there i see you had a good light at that moment, maybe in a different place and some use of that light would be a good scenery for the shot! Sorry if i was rude in any opinion! Good luck to you!', '2009-07-09 20:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567216, 805465, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but i didn''t get the idea because i don''t know what "VOX" is. I will assume it''s a drink with a lot of alcoohol, and that''s why the shoes are OOF, so as the bottle. Thinking by that way, i think the bottle is the prime object in that shot, maybe because the position and the crop doesn''t help the shoes or other reason. <br/>That''s my opinion, i liked the idea, but next time i think you could try to show the picture''s theme more cleary. <br/>Hope you don''t take this bad! Good luck for you!</td>', 'I''m sorry but i didn''t get the idea because i don''t know what "VOX" is. I will assume it''s a drink with a lot of alcoohol, and that''s why the shoes are OOF, so as the bottle. Thinking by that way, i think the bottle is the prime object in that shot, maybe because the position and the crop doesn''t help the shoes or other reason. That''s my opinion, i liked the idea, but next time i think you could try to show the picture''s theme more cleary. Hope you don''t take this bad! Good luck for you!', '2009-07-09 20:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567217, 803652, 99981, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much connection between the shoes and the pool and they are a little oof in my opinion. I think you had a good light and maybe you could have used this on your benefit. I like the way you constructed the scene by putting the shoes in that position, classy!<br/>Good luck to you, sorry if i was rude!</td>', 'I don''t see much connection between the shoes and the pool and they are a little oof in my opinion. I think you had a good light and maybe you could have used this on your benefit. I like the way you constructed the scene by putting the shoes in that position, classy!Good luck to you, sorry if i was rude!', '2009-07-09 20:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567218, 805420, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. The focus at the flag and the choice for the B&amp;W are really nice. I just don''t see the sneakers as the main theme in this image. Sorry if i was rude, ok? It''s just my opinion! Good luck to you!</td>', 'I like the shot. The focus at the flag and the choice for the B&W are really nice. I just don''t see the sneakers as the main theme in this image. Sorry if i was rude, ok? It''s just my opinion! Good luck to you!', '2009-07-09 20:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567219, 804946, 99981, '<td valign="top">I think your idea is not really clear in this shot, maybe just for me, but i don''t see connection between the sandals and that object at the right. I think i like the light and those pale colors at this shot, but i think the size will not help you to score well. Try to use the maximum size permited by DP next time, i''m sure your idea will be clearly.<br/>Good luck, sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'I think your idea is not really clear in this shot, maybe just for me, but i don''t see connection between the sandals and that object at the right. I think i like the light and those pale colors at this shot, but i think the size will not help you to score well. Try to use the maximum size permited by DP next time, i''m sure your idea will be clearly.Good luck, sorry if i was rude.', '2009-07-09 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567221, 805490, 99981, '<td valign="top">Oh, naughty shot huh!? heh! I just think that the part of the stairs (or something else) at the top is distracting, and i don''t see where is the focused part in this shot. I like the idea but maybe you could try focusing the part of the shoe where the painties are, to make your idea more clear. Try no to cut a part of your prime object too! <br/>Good luck, sorry if i was rude!</td>', 'Oh, naughty shot huh!? heh! I just think that the part of the stairs (or something else) at the top is distracting, and i don''t see where is the focused part in this shot. I like the idea but maybe you could try focusing the part of the shoe where the painties are, to make your idea more clear. Try no to cut a part of your prime object too! Good luck, sorry if i was rude!', '2009-07-09 20:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567222, 803908, 99981, '<td valign="top">I think the biggest problem on that shot is that the shoes (which are the prime object) are out of focus. I like the perspective you used, but i didn''t get the idea (not even by the title), and the flash of your camera really killed the colors and gave a harsh light at some parts of the floor and shoes.<br/>I hope you don''t take this bad, it is just my opinion.<br/>Good luck to you.</td>', 'I think the biggest problem on that shot is that the shoes (which are the prime object) are out of focus. I like the perspective you used, but i didn''t get the idea (not even by the title), and the flash of your camera really killed the colors and gave a harsh light at some parts of the floor and shoes.I hope you don''t take this bad, it is just my opinion.Good luck to you.', '2009-07-09 20:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567223, 805391, 99981, '<td valign="top">I think you had a good idea and did a good job with the colors...but the image looks oof and a little grainy for me, and that''s making it looks like a snapshot. I hope you don''t feel offended by this comment, it''s just my opinion..good luck to you!</td>', 'I think you had a good idea and did a good job with the colors...but the image looks oof and a little grainy for me, and that''s making it looks like a snapshot. I hope you don''t feel offended by this comment, it''s just my opinion..good luck to you!', '2009-07-09 20:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567224, 805236, 99981, '<td valign="top">I understand your idea by the tittle you gave to that shot, but i think that your intention isn''t clear by the image itself...the floor at the left top and the right bottom is really distracting, and the flash you used killed the colors. I really like your idea, but i think it needs more tweaking, maybe using a baby''s shoe and continue by age, it''s just an idea...try to use some time of exposure next time, so you don''t have to use the flash.<br/>Hope i was clear and helpfull...sorry if i was rude in any way.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I understand your idea by the tittle you gave to that shot, but i think that your intention isn''t clear by the image itself...the floor at the left top and the right bottom is really distracting, and the flash you used killed the colors. I really like your idea, but i think it needs more tweaking, maybe using a baby''s shoe and continue by age, it''s just an idea...try to use some time of exposure next time, so you don''t have to use the flash.Hope i was clear and helpfull...sorry if i was rude in any way.Good luck!', '2009-07-09 20:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567429, 805477, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, though it seems like it may need a little noise reduction on the background. Somehow, the composition leads my eye to that background, so the graininess was the first thing I noticed.</td>', 'I like the perspective, though it seems like it may need a little noise reduction on the background. Somehow, the composition leads my eye to that background, so the graininess was the first thing I noticed.', '2009-07-09 23:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567433, 804915, 83313, '<td valign="top">You should use the full 640 pixels that the challenge allows for image size. There may also be some excessive compression used that is taking away some detail and clarity. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'You should use the full 640 pixels that the challenge allows for image size. There may also be some excessive compression used that is taking away some detail and clarity. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-07-09 23:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
