(5567668, 804099, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great idea and concept. Execution needs some work. Overall there is a lack of contrast, most notably in the foreground from the straight on sunlight. Planning the composition to avoid surrounding buildings would give it more of a fantasy feel. The contrail is unfortunate, can''t do anything about that except coming back the next day! I like the tendency towards a tilted horizon, sort of in between a creative tilt and straight horizon. Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea and concept. Execution needs some work. Overall there is a lack of contrast, most notably in the foreground from the straight on sunlight. Planning the composition to avoid surrounding buildings would give it more of a fantasy feel. The contrail is unfortunate, can''t do anything about that except coming back the next day! I like the tendency towards a tilted horizon, sort of in between a creative tilt and straight horizon. Good luck.', '2009-07-10 03:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567670, 805357, 54645, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. I like the humor! It seems a bit soft (the feet), but it may also be that the previous 10 shots I voted on were over sharpened!!! 7</td>', 'Excellent idea. I like the humor! It seems a bit soft (the feet), but it may also be that the previous 10 shots I voted on were over sharpened!!! 7', '2009-07-10 03:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567674, 804302, 54645, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, this is fantastic, love the humor! I must admit the composition is a bit static. This would have also been great for the Ground Up challenge. Imagine a 17-20mm perspective from the grass, one boot tilted against the other, stormy sky, or shot at night with a long exposure. Creative concept, well done. 6</td>', 'Oh yeah, this is fantastic, love the humor! I must admit the composition is a bit static. This would have also been great for the Ground Up challenge. Imagine a 17-20mm perspective from the grass, one boot tilted against the other, stormy sky, or shot at night with a long exposure. Creative concept, well done. 6', '2009-07-10 03:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567676, 805420, 54645, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph. Is the flag telling us that hop scotch is an All-American past time? I like it, although I''m not sure about the flag bisecting the photograph in half.</td>', 'Interesting photograph. Is the flag telling us that hop scotch is an All-American past time? I like it, although I''m not sure about the flag bisecting the photograph in half.', '2009-07-10 03:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
