(5573578, 805020, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think it''s awfully cute, and I gave this a 6. The lighting is good. Except for a touch of some wrinkle in the upper left corner, you got a nice clear white background. The focus on the puppy is dead sharp on the eyes &amp; nose. Minor nitpicks may be cropped a little too close for my own preference, and the DOF seems a little shallow for the shot, putting the flip-flop slightly out of focus.  I think that focus on the puppy instead of the shoe could be shifting the subject away from what it should be for this challenge. Of course, I don''t know what aperture you were shooting at, but another stop or two narrower would have likely helped.</td>', 'I think it''s awfully cute, and I gave this a 6. The lighting is good. Except for a touch of some wrinkle in the upper left corner, you got a nice clear white background. The focus on the puppy is dead sharp on the eyes & nose. Minor nitpicks may be cropped a little too close for my own preference, and the DOF seems a little shallow for the shot, putting the flip-flop slightly out of focus.  I think that focus on the puppy instead of the shoe could be shifting the subject away from what it should be for this challenge. Of course, I don''t know what aperture you were shooting at, but another stop or two narrower would have likely helped.', '2009-07-14 20:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
