(5574432, 804359, 93384, '<td valign="top">Well, I liked the toes. It''s a little drama--there are the bare toes next to this thing that looks like a toy until you look closer and see that it is a hermit crab. A crab,with sharp feet and pincers--next to toes, such bare, vulnerable toes! Very nice toes. The footwear is just a little stage for the playful drama!</td>', 'Well, I liked the toes. It''s a little drama--there are the bare toes next to this thing that looks like a toy until you look closer and see that it is a hermit crab. A crab,with sharp feet and pincers--next to toes, such bare, vulnerable toes! Very nice toes. The footwear is just a little stage for the playful drama!', '2009-07-15 06:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
