(5574466, 805489, 20364, '<td valign="top">I really blew it on this one...I had been getting some high 5''s and even low and mid 6''s before putting this one up recently.  I had promised myself that I would not enter anything that was less than a certain quality standard.  I also had not planned to enter any Open Challenges.  This was an all around big mistake.  The photo was taken at such an angle that the model''s legs look like sausages....but they really aren''t...Geesh...</td>', 'I really blew it on this one...I had been getting some high 5''s and even low and mid 6''s before putting this one up recently.  I had promised myself that I would not enter anything that was less than a certain quality standard.  I also had not planned to enter any Open Challenges.  This was an all around big mistake.  The photo was taken at such an angle that the model''s legs look like sausages....but they really aren''t...Geesh...', '2009-07-15 07:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
