(5574756, 805267, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done - excellent textures and very good B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very nicely done - excellent textures and very good B&W.', '2009-07-15 10:19:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574760, 805160, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ahhh I forgot to go comment during the challenge.  I really did give this a 7 because it made me laugh.  And I didn''t feel it was too far off base because a sock really does go on the foot!  Perfect title!</td>', 'Ahhh I forgot to go comment during the challenge.  I really did give this a 7 because it made me laugh.  And I didn''t feel it was too far off base because a sock really does go on the foot!  Perfect title!', '2009-07-15 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574811, 805313, 67697, '<td valign="top">So cute!  I love the complementary muted background to contrast with the earthy green of the shoe.  Congrats on the top 10!!</td>', 'So cute!  I love the complementary muted background to contrast with the earthy green of the shoe.  Congrats on the top 10!!', '2009-07-15 10:56:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574816, 805311, 38032, '<td valign="top">You''re like Adam from American Idol  we know you should have won  almost too cool to win.  Remember Daughtry?  Same thing.  Great image, especially in basic.</td>', 'You''re like Adam from American Idol  we know you should have won  almost too cool to win.  Remember Daughtry?  Same thing.  Great image, especially in basic.', '2009-07-15 11:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574821, 805357, 37845, '<td valign="top">While I know you are disappointed by your score, here is one thing to consider; you did get 8 10''s in this challenge. While your photo didn''t appeal to everyone, it did get a very positive reaction out of those 8 people, and offended at least 12 people enough to vote you a 1. The 1''s might also be explained by some people thinking this didnt meet the challenge. While I personally think it did, others might take a more literal interpretation of the challenge title and disagree with me (and you).<br/> <br/>edited for bad spelling and grammar.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-15 10:08:13.</i></td>', 'While I know you are disappointed by your score, here is one thing to consider; you did get 8 10''s in this challenge. While your photo didn''t appeal to everyone, it did get a very positive reaction out of those 8 people, and offended at least 12 people enough to vote you a 1. The 1''s might also be explained by some people thinking this didnt meet the challenge. While I personally think it did, others might take a more literal interpretation of the challenge title and disagree with me (and you). edited for bad spelling and grammar.', '2009-07-15 11:07:20.000000', '2009-07-15 11:08:13.000000', 0),
(5574854, 805160, 37845, '<td valign="top">This one has me laughing. Doesnt deserve the score, or the placing it did. At least the commenters liked it... they gave a score of 7.2.</td>', 'This one has me laughing. Doesnt deserve the score, or the placing it did. At least the commenters liked it... they gave a score of 7.2.', '2009-07-15 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574855, 805357, 49109, '<td valign="top">As <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=37845" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">VitaminB</a> already stated, your shot suffered from the same symptoms as mine; too many narrow minded voters that thought this isn''t "footwear" in the strictest sense. This was my highest rated shot, it may not be the best technically, but among the best conceptually.</td>', 'As  VitaminB already stated, your shot suffered from the same symptoms as mine; too many narrow minded voters that thought this isn''t "footwear" in the strictest sense. This was my highest rated shot, it may not be the best technically, but among the best conceptually.', '2009-07-15 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574876, 805357, 66515, '<td valign="top">I''ll chime in with an echo of what''s been previously stated: some people weren''t able to think broad enough to have this meet the challenge. I personally thought that the idea was clever and original for the challenge. If you compare your score with the average given by commenters you''ll see that the people who "got it" generally really like it</td>', 'I''ll chime in with an echo of what''s been previously stated: some people weren''t able to think broad enough to have this meet the challenge. I personally thought that the idea was clever and original for the challenge. If you compare your score with the average given by commenters you''ll see that the people who "got it" generally really like it', '2009-07-15 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574899, 805311, 62027, '<td valign="top">I love creative shots like this. It shows how thoughtful you are, this is great artistic problem solving that you were able to fool people into thinking it was a digital effect! You should be proud :) AND, this would be a cool poster.</td>', 'I love creative shots like this. It shows how thoughtful you are, this is great artistic problem solving that you were able to fool people into thinking it was a digital effect! You should be proud :) AND, this would be a cool poster.', '2009-07-15 11:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574911, 805357, 106349, '<td valign="top">I think it was an extremely creative idea and I gave it a 7 (along with 20 other people. The fact that you got 8 10s and 12 7s is very interesting to me. It goes to show how different people view art &amp; creativity.</td>', 'I think it was an extremely creative idea and I gave it a 7 (along with 20 other people. The fact that you got 8 10s and 12 7s is very interesting to me. It goes to show how different people view art & creativity.', '2009-07-15 12:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574929, 804966, 92847, '<td valign="top">Jorge, PARABÉNS!! Very well deserved.</td>', 'Jorge, PARABÉNS!! Very well deserved.', '2009-07-15 12:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574930, 805078, 92847, '<td valign="top">Parabéns Pedro, excelente começo!!</td>', 'Parabéns Pedro, excelente começo!!', '2009-07-15 12:38:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575003, 804852, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the shot, the ribbon, and on having a wife so helpful that she''ll jump for you while injured!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats on the shot, the ribbon, and on having a wife so helpful that she''ll jump for you while injured! ', '2009-07-15 13:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575037, 804966, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Ribbon great sit up very creative. Always a pleasure to see your work on the front page. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your Ribbon great sit up very creative. Always a pleasure to see your work on the front page. :)', '2009-07-15 13:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
