(5575103, 805160, 73564, '<td valign="top">OMG! This is great! I love the craft flying by in the back ground.</td>', 'OMG! This is great! I love the craft flying by in the back ground.', '2009-07-15 14:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575223, 805321, 98663, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ThatChickOverThere:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice idea.  One thing that distracts me a bit is the line from the table in the background not being straight. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Darn I think I fixed that in one edit but decided to change my edit and forgot to fix that again. :(<br/> <br/>and as for the wrinkles I tried my best I knew they would still show up but there really wasn''t much I could do about it with my "helpers" they were getting annoyed that it was taking too long and wanted to go watch a movie. Lol oh well what can you do?</td>', 'Originally posted by ThatChickOverThere: Very nice idea.  One thing that distracts me a bit is the line from the table in the background not being straight.   Darn I think I fixed that in one edit but decided to change my edit and forgot to fix that again. :( and as for the wrinkles I tried my best I knew they would still show up but there really wasn''t much I could do about it with my "helpers" they were getting annoyed that it was taking too long and wanted to go watch a movie. Lol oh well what can you do?', '2009-07-15 15:49:45.000000', NULL, 0);
