(5575508, 804852, 82707, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon! ....I love the wellies, and your wife must be a real trooper to model with an injury.  Fabulous end result!  Well done!</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon! ....I love the wellies, and your wife must be a real trooper to model with an injury.  Fabulous end result!  Well done!', '2009-07-15 20:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
