(5575636, 805212, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea... well set out... think it''s a little soft though, and the crop may be a tad too tight, and the boots are competing with the cigar and books for interest... and I think the boots are losing.</td>', 'This is an excellent idea... well set out... think it''s a little soft though, and the crop may be a tad too tight, and the boots are competing with the cigar and books for interest... and I think the boots are losing.', '2009-07-15 21:37:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575646, 805078, 73564, '<td valign="top">LOL! I liked reading the details..Nice take on the challenge, and congrats!</td>', 'LOL! I liked reading the details..Nice take on the challenge, and congrats!', '2009-07-15 21:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575663, 804090, 88729, '<td valign="top">love the abstract sense of this, one of the more creative executions of the challenge; should have ranked higher IMO</td>', 'love the abstract sense of this, one of the more creative executions of the challenge; should have ranked higher IMO', '2009-07-15 22:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575703, 804432, 32011, '<td valign="top">Well done.  This is a very nice shot, and an excellent example of how to use selective desaturation effectively.  Composition is good, however, it may have suffered in voting a little because of the background behind the feet (is it a bush or grass area?)... a uniform background (all asphalt or all grass) may have fair a little better.</td>', 'Well done.  This is a very nice shot, and an excellent example of how to use selective desaturation effectively.  Composition is good, however, it may have suffered in voting a little because of the background behind the feet (is it a bush or grass area?)... a uniform background (all asphalt or all grass) may have fair a little better.', '2009-07-15 22:48:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575711, 805421, 32011, '<td valign="top">I like this image, and scored it relatively high.  I really like the idea, and the colour and detail, but think the ball is a tad too dominant and thus takes away from the shoes.  Great title too... though, I have to admit, I didn''t notice the title until now... I often don''t notice the title unless the image needs it to explain how it meets the challenge... your shot stands up without the help of the title though, which says a lot about it.  Well done!</td>', 'I like this image, and scored it relatively high.  I really like the idea, and the colour and detail, but think the ball is a tad too dominant and thus takes away from the shoes.  Great title too... though, I have to admit, I didn''t notice the title until now... I often don''t notice the title unless the image needs it to explain how it meets the challenge... your shot stands up without the help of the title though, which says a lot about it.  Well done!', '2009-07-15 22:52:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575716, 805414, 32011, '<td valign="top">I liked this one, and scored it well during voting.  I can''t understand how this didn''t fair better with the voters.  Sharp where it needs to be, good use of shallow DOF.  Interesting... well composed... this is most definitely worthy of a final score in the high 5''s low 6''s perhaps... think you''ve been hard done by only getting a 5.39.</td>', 'I liked this one, and scored it well during voting.  I can''t understand how this didn''t fair better with the voters.  Sharp where it needs to be, good use of shallow DOF.  Interesting... well composed... this is most definitely worthy of a final score in the high 5''s low 6''s perhaps... think you''ve been hard done by only getting a 5.39.', '2009-07-15 22:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575721, 805313, 32011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the top 10 finish, and on the Team Suck top score award for the challenge.  Well done.  Nice colour and it''s nice and sharp, which really makes the shoe pop... though I find the surface it''s on quite distracting, and the composition lacks dynamic... would have like it taken from a different perspective perhaps... but ask 3 other people what they think, you''d get 6 different opinions  :)  Again... congratulations on a very nice image and doing well in the challenge.</td>', 'Congratulations on the top 10 finish, and on the Team Suck top score award for the challenge.  Well done.  Nice colour and it''s nice and sharp, which really makes the shoe pop... though I find the surface it''s on quite distracting, and the composition lacks dynamic... would have like it taken from a different perspective perhaps... but ask 3 other people what they think, you''d get 6 different opinions  :)  Again... congratulations on a very nice image and doing well in the challenge.', '2009-07-15 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5575729, 805420, 32011, '<td valign="top">I think this image suffered in voting because the footwear wasn''t a significant enough element in the image.  I like the idea and the processing, but the shoes just aren''t even close to being the subject and the voters punished you in the voting for this.</td>', 'I think this image suffered in voting because the footwear wasn''t a significant enough element in the image.  I like the idea and the processing, but the shoes just aren''t even close to being the subject and the voters punished you in the voting for this.', '2009-07-15 23:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576100, 804579, 48954, '<td valign="top">i was sure this was going to be top 5</td>', 'i was sure this was going to be top 5', '2009-07-16 04:20:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576319, 805212, 11854, '<td valign="top">Those look like some well used books! LOL! I''ll be honest and tell you I gave this a 5 in voting as it just didn''t seem to click for me. It was well taken and the books and cigar gave it interest, but the boots didn''t add anything to that.</td>', 'Those look like some well used books! LOL! I''ll be honest and tell you I gave this a 5 in voting as it just didn''t seem to click for me. It was well taken and the books and cigar gave it interest, but the boots didn''t add anything to that.', '2009-07-16 10:24:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576320, 804432, 11854, '<td valign="top">I thought this was really cute! Love the colors!</td>', 'I thought this was really cute! Love the colors!', '2009-07-16 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576321, 805421, 11854, '<td valign="top">A poignant moment in the life of a little boy! And congrats to him, he must be so proud!</td>', 'A poignant moment in the life of a little boy! And congrats to him, he must be so proud!', '2009-07-16 10:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
