(5576331, 805420, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is really cute! I can''t believe how low the score is, especially from the commenters. I remember playing hop scotch for hours on end, day after day. LOL!</td>', 'This is really cute! I can''t believe how low the score is, especially from the commenters. I remember playing hop scotch for hours on end, day after day. LOL!', '2009-07-16 10:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576340, 805393, 33361, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JustinM:</b></div><hr/><i> weird... did you intend for this too look like it was attached to a leg that was attached to a human that was dancing or at least moving?  because it''s kind of weird to be viewing it as if there was movement without a human or non-human living foot inside of the shoe.  maybe that just makes it all the more Picasso''esque?   that said I really don''t like this photo at all.  but good luck! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Justin - read the story of Cinderella (shoe left behind) and OPEN YOUR MIND to creativity and not literalisms. : )))))</td>', 'Originally posted by JustinM: weird... did you intend for this too look like it was attached to a leg that was attached to a human that was dancing or at least moving?  because it''s kind of weird to be viewing it as if there was movement without a human or non-human living foot inside of the shoe.  maybe that just makes it all the more Picasso''esque?   that said I really don''t like this photo at all.  but good luck!   Justin - read the story of Cinderella (shoe left behind) and OPEN YOUR MIND to creativity and not literalisms. : )))))', '2009-07-16 10:42:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576402, 805311, 52549, '<td valign="top">Oliver, this is a fantastic shot, definitely ribbon material and so very creative. Can''t understand the 1,2,3 votes....</td>', 'Oliver, this is a fantastic shot, definitely ribbon material and so very creative. Can''t understand the 1,2,3 votes....', '2009-07-16 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576423, 804852, 24454, '<td valign="top">:)!  What can you say.  This just makes me smile on so many levels!   If it ever rains in San Antonio again, I MUST have some of those boots :)<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS on a new personal best and top honors with this one!<br/> <br/></td>', ':)!  What can you say.  This just makes me smile on so many levels!   If it ever rains in San Antonio again, I MUST have some of those boots :) CONGRATULATIONS on a new personal best and top honors with this one! ', '2009-07-16 11:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576424, 804966, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very, very, VERY cool!  (of course!)<br/></td>', 'Very, very, VERY cool!  (of course!)', '2009-07-16 12:00:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576441, 805311, 24454, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  Congratulations on an honorable mention.  What a tribute in a challenge like this!</td>', 'Brilliant!  Congratulations on an honorable mention.  What a tribute in a challenge like this!', '2009-07-16 12:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576790, 805209, 18799, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in the challenge, nor did I look at the entries.  Having said that, I actually rather like this.  I like the negative space, I like the upside down look, I like that it''s different from all the rest.  I think it would have scored better if they were real feet though as DPC generally does not reward photos of toys well. The other thing is maybe if the feet were further from the background, the shadow would have been minimized.     If I had voted, I would have given it a strong 6, maybe a 7.<br/> <br/>Good job on leaving the box - unfortunately you usually pay the price for it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-16 18:02:31.</i></td>', 'I didn''t vote in the challenge, nor did I look at the entries.  Having said that, I actually rather like this.  I like the negative space, I like the upside down look, I like that it''s different from all the rest.  I think it would have scored better if they were real feet though as DPC generally does not reward photos of toys well. The other thing is maybe if the feet were further from the background, the shadow would have been minimized.     If I had voted, I would have given it a strong 6, maybe a 7. Good job on leaving the box - unfortunately you usually pay the price for it.', '2009-07-16 18:58:52.000000', '2009-07-16 19:02:31.000000', 0),
(5576800, 804966, 108313, '<td valign="top">Hey Jorge! Great picture as always! Nevertheless you never stop surprising me :)<br/>I gotta say I''m really lucky and honored to spend some time and learn from you now and then.<br/>Let''s toast together?!<br/></td>', 'Hey Jorge! Great picture as always! Nevertheless you never stop surprising me :)I gotta say I''m really lucky and honored to spend some time and learn from you now and then.Let''s toast together?!', '2009-07-16 19:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576804, 804852, 108313, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the splashes and colorful interesting boots! With such a dedicated wife I guess more ribbons will come soon ;)<br/>Congrats and hope your wife gets better soon.</td>', 'Great capture of the splashes and colorful interesting boots! With such a dedicated wife I guess more ribbons will come soon ;)Congrats and hope your wife gets better soon.', '2009-07-16 19:15:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576811, 805475, 108313, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting idea. I know you gonna score better next time as you''re a really good photographer.<br/>Cheers, my friend!<br/> <br/></td>', 'It''s an interesting idea. I know you gonna score better next time as you''re a really good photographer.Cheers, my friend! ', '2009-07-16 19:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
