(5578265, 804785, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hello found this in the Critique Club section:<br/> <br/>I think the subject is perfect for the challenge, more of a part of a costume than a casual set of footwear. I think the centering is good, and low crop adds to the mystery, maybe more leg won''t hurt.<br/> <br/>I think some flaws are in the background. There is no atmosphere, and the floor and background are bland. Maybe a street would be metter, or sidewalk curb. I think the photo scored what I would rate it. Good production though.</td>', 'Hello found this in the Critique Club section: I think the subject is perfect for the challenge, more of a part of a costume than a casual set of footwear. I think the centering is good, and low crop adds to the mystery, maybe more leg won''t hurt. I think some flaws are in the background. There is no atmosphere, and the floor and background are bland. Maybe a street would be metter, or sidewalk curb. I think the photo scored what I would rate it. Good production though.', '2009-07-18 06:56:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5578276, 805078, 89723, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Welcome to DPC you will love the experience and I look forward to seeing your future work.<br/> <br/>I just realized after reading your post that you beat your mentor. How awesome is that? Not only is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=56744" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">De Sousa</a> an exceptional photographer, but he also shares his wonderful talents. Bravo to both of you. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-18 06:58:34.</i></td>', 'Congratulations! Welcome to DPC you will love the experience and I look forward to seeing your future work. I just realized after reading your post that you beat your mentor. How awesome is that? Not only is  De Sousa an exceptional photographer, but he also shares his wonderful talents. Bravo to both of you. ', '2009-07-18 07:56:15.000000', '2009-07-18 07:58:34.000000', 0),
(5578551, 805311, 33769, '<td valign="top">i was one of your 12 10''s  before it got validated - specks of lint or not (which can only be edited out in advanced) this is an -amazing- take on shoes ;) if u had titled it something like ''all natural'' i would have been in stitches laughing - as it was i was giggling when i saw it because I was really hoping to see something fun in this challenge when i started looking thru it... this thumbnail jumped out at me! :-D  ;) sorry for the belated comment :-) But major kudos on this pic -- don''t mind the trolls they cant help it ;) and yeah they do get on everyone''s nerves... Lookin forward to seeing your next entry! :-)</td>', 'i was one of your 12 10''s  before it got validated - specks of lint or not (which can only be edited out in advanced) this is an -amazing- take on shoes ;) if u had titled it something like ''all natural'' i would have been in stitches laughing - as it was i was giggling when i saw it because I was really hoping to see something fun in this challenge when i started looking thru it... this thumbnail jumped out at me! :-D  ;) sorry for the belated comment :-) But major kudos on this pic -- don''t mind the trolls they cant help it ;) and yeah they do get on everyone''s nerves... Lookin forward to seeing your next entry! :-)', '2009-07-18 16:44:28.000000', NULL, 0),
